      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have the same problem. Sometimes when people join a world you are in the either get stuck at the spawn or at world origin. For me it happens very often. I'll try to gather more information about this. It happens pretty random so far. Sometimes it also happen when i join someone and everyone in the world is stuck at spawn or world origin but it happens less often. It could be related to the internet speed since i have a 1Gbit connection and avatars load very fast but i don't know. It happens to friends of me less often than for me. This bug is a really annoying one since it's so often. This bug started to appear after the last big vr chat update.",
